"George's got 45% more pears than bananas. If he's got 200 bananas, how many fruits does he have?","George has 45% more pears than bananas. If George has 200 bananas, how many fruits does George have?",490,490,490,490,"George has 200 bananas. He has 45% more pears than bananas. 

