Now, he made 200 mini cinnamon rolls. Each has 200 calories. So the total for the cinnamon rolls would be 200 multiplied by 200. Let me compute that. 200 x 200 is... 40,000 calories. Because 200 x 2 is 400, times 100 (since it's 200 each time) gives 40,000.

