"Rani's totally into sports cars. She's curious about the fastest car ever, so she googles it. Turns out, the fastest car was 1.25 times quicker than the runner-up. That second fastest car? It was 5 times speedier than your average car, which hits 120 mph. So, how fast is that top car?",Rani is obsessed with sports cars. She wonders what the faster car ever made can go so she looks it up. What she finds out is that the fastest car was 1.25 times faster than the 2nd fastest car. The 2nd fastest car was 5 times faster than the average car. The average car can go 120 Miles per hour. How fast does the faster car go?,750,750,750,750,"The average car's speed is 120 mph.  
